    'Wedding venue owners value scenic property aesthetics. Our Fort Worth installers run concealed wiring inside wood beams, painted conduit, or underground trenching to preserve your romantic venue grounds.',
    'We install camera systems for wedding venues, rustic event barns, garden estates, and historic reception halls across Fort Worth, Weatherford, Burleson, Mansfield, Saginaw, Haltom City, the AllianceTexas corridor, Keller, Southlake, Colleyville, and Grapevine, plus the Stockyards, Cultural District, and downtown Fort Worth. All low-voltage work meets City of Fort Worth and Tarrant County requirements. We plan concealed beam routing and color-matched hardware during the walkthrough so the property still photographs beautifully, and we reach detached ceremony lawns, arbors, and parking with wireless bridges or drive-line conduit instead of trenching your turf. Outdoor hardware is IP67 and IK10 rated, UV stable, and surge protected for North Texas hail, lightning, and triple-digit heat, with recorders in locked conditioned space. Installations are scheduled midweek against your booking calendar, and local crews export footage same day for a police report or an insurance claim.',
